#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat2_2F/scripts.inc:24
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat2_2F_Text_DevonWasTinyInOldDays"
msgid ""
"Way back in the old days, DEVON was just\n"
"a teeny, tiny company.$"
msgstr ""
"很久很久以前，得文公司\n"
"只是一家小小的公司。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat2_2F/scripts.inc:28
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat2_2F_Text_MyDaddyMadeThisYouCanHaveIt"
msgid ""
"My daddy's working at the CORPORATION.\p"
"My daddy made this!\n"
"But I can't use it, so you can have it.$"
msgstr ""
"我爸爸在公司里上班。\p"
"这是我爸爸做的！\n"
"可是我用不了，就送给你吧。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat2_2F/scripts.inc:33
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat2_2F_Text_GoingToWorkAtDevonToo"
msgid ""
"My daddy's working at the CORPORATION.\p"
"When I grow up, I'm going to work for\n"
"DEVON, too.$"
msgstr ""
"我爸爸在公司里上班。\p"
"等我长大了，\n"
"我也要去得文公司上班。$"
